  "prefLabel": "Ac 102.18 Semester Hour",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 102.18 “Semester Hour” means the number of hours which a class meets during a single semester, expressed on a per-credit basis, as calculated by the institution offering the course.\n\nSource. #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 101.17); renumbered by #13995 (formerly Ac 102.17)",
